R CLUB", "followers": 773059}}, {"tweet_id": "2098988674734063658", "created_at": "Sun Sep 13 04:14:32 +0000 2026", "text": "But Original Content wants the platform to be like TikTok and Youtube. \n\nX/ twitter leadership do not have a global mind set and want to police people, on what to post and not to post.\n\nDifferent countries have their own breaking news, trends and topics. What is original and not", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 1, "retweets": 1, "replies": 1, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 0}, "author": {"user_id": "907975864360501248", "username": "TheCleanCarClub", "display_name": "CLEAN CAR CLUB", "followers": 773059}}, {"tweet_id": "2098988678563451015", "created_at": "Sun Sep 13 04:14:32 +0000 2026", "text": "Or", "language": "qst", "metrics": {"likes": 1, "retweets": 0, "replies": 0, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 0}, "author": {"user_id": "907975864360501248", "username": "TheCleanCarClub", "display_name": "CLEAN CAR CLUB", "followers": 773059}}, {"tweet_id": "2098960142054113320", "created_at": "Sun Sep 13 02:21:09 +0000 2026", "text": "Would you buy a green car https://t.co/DtznfLiSnr", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 14, "retweets": 1, "replies": 7, "quotes": 1, "bookmarks": 1}, "author": {"user_id": "907975864360501248", "username": "TheCleanCarClub", "display_name": "CLEAN CAR CLUB", "followers": 773059}}, {"tweet_id": "2098960118243119142", "created_at": "Sun Sep 13 02:21:03 +0000 2026", "text": "Cellphone holder https://t.co/HE6ybAZeD1", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 2563, "retweets": 162, "replies": 33, "quotes": 9, "bookmarks": 879}, "author": {"user_id": "907975864360501248", "username": "TheCleanCarClub", "display_name": "CLEAN CAR CLUB", "followers": 773059}}, {"tweet_id": "2098960078707569111", "created_at": "Sun Sep 13 02:20:54 +0000 2026", "text": "Car cleaning gel https://t.co/38Trz1XZgu", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 90, "retweets": 15, "replies": 3, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 27}, "author": {"user_id": "90797