Sep 13 02:09:31 +0000 2026", "text": "Shadow of the Colossus (2018) https://t.co/0NWz9SokH8", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 3116, "retweets": 312, "replies": 12, "quotes": 28, "bookmarks": 282}, "author": {"user_id": "1622468827756773378", "username": "nf_real1", "display_name": "هيوجو🪄🎮", "followers": 7388}}, {"tweet_id": "2098956832366838060", "created_at": "Sun Sep 13 02:08:00 +0000 2026", "text": "“Temple” by ProfDyer. I love sci-fi art that makes you feel like you’ve stumbled upon something humanity was never supposed to find. This one absolutely nails that feeling. https://t.co/wXg6FEBsyW", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 2350, "retweets": 240, "replies": 10, "quotes": 2, "bookmarks": 374}, "author": {"user_id": "1614109226560798720", "username": "SciFiArchives", "display_name": "Sci-Fi Archives", "followers": 115370}}, {"tweet_id": "2098913863550878011", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 23:17:15 +0000 2026", "text": "Feyd-Rautha’s introduction in Dune: Part Two immediately makes him feel completely different from everyone else. Villeneuve throws us into the Harkonnen world of Giedi Prime and lets Austin Butler dominate the screen almost instantly. https://t.co/1ga0JMWuW2", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 65, "retweets": 17, "replies": 1, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 12}, "author": {"user_id": "1614109226560798720", "username": "SciFiArchives", "display_name": "Sci-Fi Archives", "followers": 115370}}, {"tweet_id": "2098896182802063440", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 22:07:00 +0000 2026", "text": "Frank Frazetta’s The Silver Warrior (1972). I love how Frazetta could make fantasy feel like ancient legend rather than fiction. There’s something almost mythological about this one. https://t.co/DeVvNlZoSZ", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 1104, "retweets": 119, "replies": 12, "quotes": 2, "bookmarks": 91}, "author": {"user_id": "1614109226560798720", "username": "SciFiArchives", "display_name": "Sci-Fi Archives", "followers": 115370}}, {"tweet_id": "2098879321431744990", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 21:00:00 +0000 2026", "text": "IShowSpeed ran into a giant Messi supporter from Botswana who wasn’t afraid to back Messi right in his face 😭 https://t.co/PkL5lHjMsL", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 174, "retweets": 3, "replies": 6, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 13}, "author": {"user_id": "1480344949380026369", "username": "hoodwild_", "display_name": "Hood Wild", "followers": 489509}}, {"tweet_id": "2098868500253040826", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 20:17:00 +0000 2026", "text": "Syd Mead’s concept art for an Arctic Mobile Operation Base. A colossal tracked vehicle designed as a self-contained habitat, turning an expedition base into something that could move across the ice. https://t.co/8frAKSqWxd", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 920, "retweets": 113, "replies": 1, "quotes": 1, "bookmarks": 128}, "author": {"user_id": "1614109226560798720", "username": "SciFiArchives", "display_name": "Sci-Fi Archives", "followers": 115370}}, {"tweet_id": "2098865983725420831", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 20:07:00 +0000 2026", "text": "Anne Francis as Altaira in Forbidden Planet. There’s something wonderful about how 1950s sci-fi imagined the future: part space age, part high fashion, and completely unlike anything we would design today. https://t.co/NqxbbZSXjG", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 189, "retweets": 19, "replies": 4, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 16}, "author": {"user_id": "1614109226560798720", "username": "SciFiArchives", "display_name": "Sci-Fi Archives", "followers": 115370}}, {"tweet_id": "2098859188868845585", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 19:40:00 +0000 2026", "text": "This guy caught a fish and noticed an eagle eyeing it, so he did something totally unexpected https://t.co/fGGBJZupGc", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 319, "retweets": 12, "replies": 0, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 29}, "author": {"user_id": "1480344949380026369", "username": "hoodwild_", "display_name": "Hood Wild", "followers": 489509}}, {"tweet_id": "2098850248747831376", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 19:04:28 +0000 2026", "text": "Assassin's Creed Shadows https://t.co/sY8PWkGYEZ", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 79, "retweets": 5, "replies": 1, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 6}, "author": {"user_id": "1622468827756773378", "username": "nf_real1", "display_name": "هيوجو🪄🎮", "followers": 7388}}, {"tweet_id": "2098838301323235765", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 18:17:00 +0000 2026", "text": "The sci-fi art of Japanese artist Naoyuki Kato, blending astronauts, strange machines and alien landscapes into visions of space exploration that feel both mechanical and surreal. https://t.co/tAeM5Jkzcu", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 559, "retweets": 84, "replies": 3, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 66}, "author": {"user_id": "1614109226560798720", "username": "SciFiArchives", "display_name": "Sci-Fi Archives", "followers": 115370}}, {"tweet_id": "2098838049585021398", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 18:16:00 +0000 2026", "text": "Peter Elson made Venus look impossibly inviting. Gorgeous cover art for Oceans of Venus. https://t.co/n0KztoC1uJ", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 520, "retweets": 66, "replies": 1, "quotes": 2, "bookmarks": 45}, "author": {"user_id": "1614109226560798720", "username": "SciFiArchives", "display_name": "Sci-Fi Archives", "followers": 115370}}, {"tweet_id": "2098837797813805113", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 18:15:00 +0000 2026", "text": "Usher fans are demanding refunds after allegedly claiming a look-alike performed a few songs last night 😭🎤 https://t.co/FQN1fSM8IJ", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 106, "retweets": 2, "replies": 0, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 10}, "author": {"user_id": "1480344949380026369", "username": "hoodwild_", "display_name": "Hood Wild", "followers": 489509}}, {"tweet_id": "2098835784736686311", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 18:07:00 +0000 2026", "text": "Stunning Starship Troopers artwork by Naoyuki Kato from 1977. I love the sheer bulk of the powered armor, almost more machine than soldier, towering over a ruined alien landscape beneath that enormous glowing planet. https://t.co/LMtxFNnSru", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 1889, "retweets": 427, "replies": 15, "quotes": 18, "bookmarks": 232}, "author": {"user_id": "1614109226560798720", "username": "SciFiArchives", "display_name": "Sci-Fi Archives", "followers": 115370}}, {"tweet_id": "2098831123539247276", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 17:48:28 +0000 2026", "text": "The most powerful method ever invented for controlling a population is distraction. Ancient Rome perfected it 2000 years ago, and it is being used on you right now...\n\nFor centuries the Roman citizen was the proudest political animal on earth. He voted. He chose the men who led https://t.co/CRzZ8iiQOr", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 2256, "retweets": 667, "replies": 84, "quotes": 95, "bookmarks": 421}, "author": {"user_id": "1027214104661028864", "username": "JamesLucasIT", "display_name": "James Lucas", "followers": 819519}}, {"tweet_id": "2098823956979445893", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 17:20:00 +0000 2026", "text": "These European women went on vacation to Africa and quickly realized the trip wasn’t going as planned https://t.co/8k93kyHbGS", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 165, "retweets": 1, "replies": 1, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 21}, "author": {"user_id": "1480344949380026369", "username": "hoodwild_", "display_name": "Hood Wild", "followers": 489509}}, {"tweet_id": "2098800893080604954", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 15:48:21 +0000 2026", "text": "Astronaut Frank Culbertson, aboard the ISS, was the only American to witness the 9/11 attacks from space. https://t.co/570PjeALlk", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 406, "retweets": 42, "replies": 1, "quotes": 1, "bookmarks": 47}, "author": {"user_id": "1614109226560798720", "username": "SciFiArchives", "display_name": "Sci-Fi Archives", "followers": 115370}}, {"tweet_id": "2098777903299432488", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 14:17:00 +0000 2026", "text": "Philippe Caza’s artwork for Isaac Asimov’s The Rest of the Robots (1987), imagining the relationship between humans and machines with a strangely intimate, almost romantic vision of robotics. https://t.co/kCKEKz52BZ", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 242, "retweets": 32, "replies": 4, "quotes": 0, "bookmarks": 31}, "author": {"user_id": "1614109226560798720", "username": "SciFiArchives", "display_name": "Sci-Fi Archives", "followers": 115370}}, {"tweet_id": "2098775135146950845", "created_at": "Sat Sep 12 14:06:00 +0000 2026", "text": "“SNAKE GUN” by Sergey Tsimmen. A revolver concept built around serpentine forms, from the sculpted grip to the scales and coiling details across the barrel. https://t.co/SG6pzrM13P", "language": "en", "metrics": {"likes": 1269, "retweets": 131, "replies": 6, "quotes": 3, "bookmarks": 298}, "author": {"user_id": "1614109226560798720", "username": "SciFiArchives", "display_name": "Sci-Fi Archives", "followers": 115370}}]}}}
